ocks the impact  of the bull kit is shocked to see this  and i like that she's going down like  this continuing to impress big mom says  he's really weighed her down with this  so not only is kid distracting her he's  also slowed her down trying to make  certain that law's last attack doesn't  miss as he mentioned she summons the  attack misery or 3 000 leagues which is  kind of like her own giant weather mecca  except she doesn't need to pilot it and  it has like a living life of its own  kind of thing but the impressiveness of  the attack is short-lived the tower is  dropped on big mom then law uses his  finisher of which big mom is visibly  really afraid of his sword extends all  the way to the ground below not just the  ground of the island but the ground  below the floating island as well law  says it's gotta be deeper implying the  further down it goes the more powerful  it is his men are worried that law is  going to die since big mom is hockey  punching him but he remains focused like  a boss he unleashes the attack puncture  will a which i may have pronounced very  wrong but whatever and wow the shock  waves are crazy it looks like a meteor  hit the ground below and big mom is in a  lot of pain coughing up blood even momo  wonders how that big crater got there  big mom's living attack misery is about  to burn law to ash and then epically and  hilariously law says now eustis to which  kid has to say again in the heat of this  epic battle and right where it's about  to end how many times will i have to say  it don't tell me what to do of course  kid does it anyways though again  preparing to take the final flashy shot  and it's cool how law actually invited  him to do so this time around and the  trump card does not disappoint it's not  just a big physical move as usual he  forms a giant cannon big mom a boss in  her own right to the end tells him to  give her his best shot and kid says i am  big mom that's why i'm gonna finish you  off end quote goosebumps e